Upstream-Name: xbee2mqtt
Source: https://github.com/amd989/xbee2mqtt
Comment: The Python packages xbee2mqtt needs (PyYAML, pyserial, paho-mqtt,
 parse, XBee) are installed from PyPI into /usr/lib/xbee2mqtt/vendor when the
 package is built. Each keeps its own license in its *.dist-info folder there.

